331	     * Find the owners already stored whose derived {@link Owner#getIdentityKey() identity key}
332	     * equals the given key. Used as the single duplicate-detection check at creation time: a new
333	     * owner is a duplicate only when its whole identity key matches an existing owner's.
334	     */
335	    @Override
336	    @Transactional(readOnly = true)
